<title>HONG KONG: Star Enter interim net loss HK$30.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Star Enter interim net loss HK$30.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.0 loss  vs 3.7 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  25.99 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.70 loss vs 10.46 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22.57	vs 35.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 Star Entertainment (International</p>
<p>				     Holding) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Star Entertainment produces, distributes and sells film and karaoke laser discs and videotipes.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on write-down of stocks to net realisable value and write-off of royalty prepayments.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
